# The annotations of screen/screen (kit/mkgame.py --part src/screen/screen.json). Format: ../../../../docs/ann-format.md.
#
# Side A block 5, the loading screen: 6912 bytes read by the loader's LdBytesReversed to $4000 (src/loader). Witness:
# c1 (work/stage1/c1, power-on, side A at ROM speed): the screen arrives line by line from frame 1236 and stays until
# the game's entry at frame 13 998 (work/stage1/images/loading.png).

@module screen ; The loading screen
@about The display file and the attributes as one resource, src/res/screens/loading.png (tools/res_formats.py). No code reads it: it is shown while the game block loads and overwritten by the game's first screen.

$4000 b LoadingScreen ; The loading screen: 6144 bytes of pixels, then 768 attributes
> The Core Design logo and the Rick Dangerous 2 title picture. The game's entry clears the screen for the control menu (c1, frame 14 007 on).
@res screens/loading.bin
